# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Cached downloads and derived data: every byte is reproducible from the
# scripts, and the trip parquets alone are hundreds of megabytes.
data/*

# Except the trained weights and the two files of numbers they produced. 2.3 MB
# buys a repository that is self-contained: the visuals and the README figures
# can be rebuilt without retraining, and the figures keep matching the exact
# model that produced the published scores rather than a later re-run of it.
!data/runs/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
